Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:17.19,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fn@萝莉体-DDC.yolan\b0\fs20\c&H494949&\frz260.1\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\move(1198.61,372.187,1289.277,372.187,18,3230)}呼呼\N坂本\N久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:17.19,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@萝莉体-DDC.yolan\b0\fs20\c&H343434&\frz260.1\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\move(1121.2,554.689,1211.867,553.927,18,3230)}你來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.19,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@萝莉体-DDC.yolan\b0\fs20\c&H696969&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\frz263.5\move(693.696,623.819,791.982,623.057,18,3480)}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.19,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@萝莉体-DDC.yolan\b0\fs18\c&H696969&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\frz263.4\move(520.282,186,618.06,186,18,3480)}真是次辛苦的旅行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.56,0:22:17.19,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@萝莉体-DDC.yolan\b0\fs18\c&H696969&\frz260.1\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\move(292.579,94.684,394.397,94.684,23,3610)}又是電車延誤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:17.19,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@萝莉体-DDC.yolan\b0\fs16\c&H696969&\frz260.1\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\move(224.05,73.63,330.183,73.63,17,3730)}又是撞上野豬
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.19,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@萝莉体-DDC.yolan\b0\fs20\c&H696969&\frz260.1\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\move(519.023,403,617.689,403,18,3480)}哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:17.19,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@萝莉体-DDC.yolan\b0\fs20\c&H696969&\frz260.1\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\move(532.045,529.8,630.045,529.8,18,3480)}又在開玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:17.19,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@萝莉体-DDC.yolan\b0\fs20\c&H414141&\frz260.1\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\move(144.935,425,250.268,425,17,3730)}我說的是真的
