Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:51.73,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn@萝莉体-DDC.yolan\b0\fs25\c&H696969&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\frz314.2\move(361.411,-71.419,568.744,197.914,23,10784)}…
